  "reason": "Evidence: config_045 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted, multiprofile) is the current best at 0.725 accuracy / 0.685 F1. All scvi_n200 + multiprofile + transformer experiments confirm this architecture family is optimal. The only untested single-variable change from the best config is fusion type (concat vs weighted). While weighted outperformed concat in the scgpt experiments (0.520 vs 0.507), scvi_n200 produces fundamentally different (richer, denoised) representations where the relative benefit of weighted vs concat fusion is uncertain. This experiment tests whether concat fusion could match or exceed weighted fusion when paired with scvi_n200's representations. It is the best use of experiment 7 because: (1) it is a minimal, interpretable perturbation of the current best, (2) it is cheap (~3.5 GPU hours, similar to config_045's 3.60), keeping total cost manageable, and (3) with 3 experiments remaining, confirming or ruling out a small fusion improvement lets us lock in the best configuration confidently. Expected relative cost: low, comparable to config_045."
}

